{"seq":1,"slug":"electroanalytical","title":"电化学分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/applications/electroanalytical","wordCount":1845,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"电化学分析方法\">电化学分析方法</h1><p>电化学测量有一个其它分析手段难以匹敌的优势：它直接读出电信号——电压、电流、电荷——这些量天然适合数字化、微型化、连续监测。一只指尖大小的血糖试纸，背后就是一套完整的电化学传感系统。本篇把前面建立的全部理论变现为分析工具：用平衡电位测浓度的电位法、用电流随电位扫描的伏安法、以及测界面阻抗的交流阻抗谱，看它们各自榨取了哪条基本规律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电化学分析按「控制什么、测什么」分为几大类。电位分析法在零电流下测电极的平衡电位，靠 <a href=\"../fundamentals/nernst-equation\">能斯特方程</a> 把电位换算成浓度；伏安/安培法控制电极电位、测响应电流，电流大小反映待测物浓度与反应动力学；电导分析法测溶液整体导电能力；电量分析法靠 <a href=\"../fundamentals/cells-faraday\">法拉第定律</a> 由电荷量定量物质。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[电化学分析] --&gt; B[电位法&lt;br/&gt;零电流测电位]&#10;  A --&gt; C[伏安/安培法&lt;br/&gt;控电位测电流]&#10;  A --&gt; D[电导法&lt;br/&gt;测溶液电导]&#10;  A --&gt; E[电量法&lt;br/&gt;积分电荷]&#10;  B --&gt; F[能斯特方程换算浓度]&#10;  C --&gt; G[极限电流∝浓度]&#10;  D --&gt; H[离子总浓度]&#10;  E --&gt; I[法拉第定律定量]\">flowchart TD\n  A[电化学分析] --&gt; B[电位法&lt;br/&gt;零电流测电位]\n  A --&gt; C[伏安/安培法&lt;br/&gt;控电位测电流]\n  A --&gt; D[电导法&lt;br/&gt;测溶液电导]\n  A --&gt; E[电量法&lt;br/&gt;积分电荷]\n  B --&gt; F[能斯特方程换算浓度]\n  C --&gt; G[极限电流∝浓度]\n  D --&gt; H[离子总浓度]\n  E --&gt; I[法拉第定律定量]</pre><p>下表对比主要方法的控制量、测量量与理论依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>控制量</th>\n<th>测量量</th>\n<th>理论依据</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电位法</td>\n<td>零电流</td>\n<td>平衡电位</td>\n<td>能斯特方程</td>\n<td>pH 计、离子选择电极</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环伏安法</td>\n<td>扫描电位</td>\n<td>电流</td>\n<td>巴特勒-福尔默 + 扩散</td>\n<td>机理研究、表征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安培法</td>\n<td>恒电位</td>\n<td>稳态电流</td>\n<td>极限扩散电流</td>\n<td>血糖仪、溶氧仪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阻抗谱</td>\n<td>小幅交流电位</td>\n<td>阻抗</td>\n<td>电荷转移电阻 + 双电层</td>\n<td>界面/腐蚀/电池诊断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"电位分析法-把电位读成浓度\">电位分析法：把电位读成浓度</h2><p>电位法是 <a href=\"../fundamentals/nernst-equation\">能斯特方程</a> 最直接的应用。在几乎零电流的条件下测量指示电极相对参比电极的电位，电位与待测离子浓度的对数呈线性。玻璃 pH 电极的膜电位对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[H^+]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 敏感，按 59.2 mV/pH 的能斯特斜率换算；针对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Na^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ca^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NO_3^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0778em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 等设计的离子选择电极（ISE），用对特定离子选择性响应的敏感膜，是临床血气分析、环境水质监测的主力。</p>\n<p>电位法的关键在「零电流」——只有不流过净电流，电极才处于 <a href=\"../fundamentals/nernst-equation\">能斯特方程</a> 描述的平衡态，测得的才是真正的平衡电位。一旦有电流，过电位就会污染读数，这正是电位法与下面伏安法的根本分野。</p>\n<h2 id=\"伏安法与安培法-让电流说话\">伏安法与安培法：让电流说话</h2><p>伏安法主动改变电极电位、记录电流响应。循环伏安法（CV）把电位在两个限值间往复线性扫描，得到的「电流-电位」曲线（伏安图）像一张指纹，能读出反应的氧化还原电位、可逆性、电子转移数乃至吸附行为，是研究电极机理的标准入门工具。曲线上的峰电流来自 <a href=\"../kinetics/mass-transport-polarization\">传质与极化</a> 里的扩散控制——电位扫过氧化还原电位时反应骤然加快，随即被扩散限制而出现电流峰。</p>\n<p>安培法则把电位固定在 <a href=\"../kinetics/mass-transport-polarization\">传质与极化</a> 里讲的极限电流平台上，此时电流由扩散控制、正比于待测物浓度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>D</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j_L = nFDc_b/\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>。这条线性关系就是定量传感的基础。最成功的例子是血糖仪：葡萄糖被酶氧化产生的电子经介体传到电极，产生的电流正比于血糖浓度，几秒出结果。溶氧电极、生化需氧量传感器都用同一原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交流阻抗谱-透视界面\">交流阻抗谱：透视界面</h2><p>电化学阻抗谱（EIS）施加一个小幅正弦交流电位、测量电流响应的幅值和相位，在不同频率下扫描，从而把电极界面的各个物理过程「按时间尺度分开」。它的解读建立在 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 与 <a href=\"../kinetics/double-layer\">双电层与界面</a> 之上：高频区反映溶液电阻，中频区的半圆直径给出 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 里的电荷转移电阻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{ct}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，与双电层电容并联；低频区的斜线（Warburg 阻抗）则揭示扩散控制。</p>\n<p>EIS 是无损诊断利器：测电池内阻随老化的演变、监测涂层下金属的腐蚀进程（见 <a href=\"corrosion-protection\">腐蚀与防护</a>）、评估燃料电池催化层的衰减，都靠它在不破坏样品的前提下分离出各环节的贡献。一张 Nyquist 图（虚部对实部作图）就能同时读出动力学和传质信息，这是其它单一测量难以做到的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参比电极与三电极体系\">参比电极与三电极体系</h2><p>所有定量电化学测量都绕不开一个工程细节：如何准确控制和测量电位。答案是三电极体系——工作电极（研究对象）、参比电极（提供稳定的电位基准，如 Ag/AgCl 或饱和甘汞电极）、对电极（构成电流回路）。电位测量在工作电极与参比电极之间进行（几乎零电流，避免参比电极极化），而电流在工作电极与对电极间流过。这种分工巧妙地绕开了 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 里讲的过电位会污染参比电位的难题，是现代电化学工作站的标准配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"法拉第电流与非法拉第电流的分离\">法拉第电流与非法拉第电流的分离</h2><p>所有电化学测量都要面对一个干扰：测到的电流里，既有真正反映反应的法拉第电流，也有给 <a href=\"../kinetics/double-layer\">双电层与界面</a> 充放电的非法拉第（充电）电流。后者与待测物浓度无关，却会淹没微弱的分析信号，限制检测灵敏度。</p>\n<p>历代电分析技术的进步，很大程度上就是想方设法把这两种电流分开。经典极谱法用滴汞电极，靠汞滴周期性脱落刷新界面；脉冲伏安法（如微分脉冲、方波伏安）则利用一个关键时间差——施加电位阶跃后，充电电流随时间指数衰减得很快，而法拉第电流衰减得慢，于是在阶跃后期采样就能滤掉大部分充电电流。这一技巧把检测限从极谱法的约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-5}\\,\\mathrm{mol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span> 推进到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-8}\\,\\mathrm{mol/L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mol/L</span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级，使痕量重金属、药物分子的电化学检测成为可能。</p>\n<p>理解充电电流的来源，必须回到 <a href=\"../kinetics/double-layer\">双电层与界面</a> 的微分电容——电容越大、扫描越快，充电电流就越大。这也解释了为何高灵敏度分析往往采用慢扫描或脉冲技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电化学分析按控制/测量量分为电位法、伏安/安培法、电导法、电量法，分别变现能斯特、扩散极限电流、电导、法拉第定律。</li>\n<li>电位法在零电流下测平衡电位、按能斯特斜率换算浓度，pH 计与离子选择电极是代表，关键在不流净电流。</li>\n<li>循环伏安法是机理研究的指纹工具，峰电流源自扩散控制；安培法在极限电流平台测正比浓度的电流，血糖仪是典范。</li>\n<li>交流阻抗谱按频率分离溶液电阻、电荷转移电阻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{ct}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、双电层电容与扩散，是电池、腐蚀、燃料电池的无损诊断利器。</li>\n<li>三电极体系用参比电极提供基准、对电极走电流，巧妙避开过电位污染电位读数，是定量测量的标准配置。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电化学分析方法","id":"电化学分析方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"电位分析法：把电位读成浓度","id":"电位分析法-把电位读成浓度"},{"level":2,"text":"伏安法与安培法：让电流说话","id":"伏安法与安培法-让电流说话"},{"level":2,"text":"交流阻抗谱：透视界面","id":"交流阻抗谱-透视界面"},{"level":2,"text":"参比电极与三电极体系","id":"参比电极与三电极体系"},{"level":2,"text":"法拉第电流与非法拉第电流的分离","id":"法拉第电流与非法拉第电流的分离"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"燃料电池与超级电容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/batteries/fuel-cell-supercap"},"next":{"title":"腐蚀与防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/applications/corrosion-protection"}}